{"id":"a3-u02","level":"a3","order":2,"title":{"en":"Nuance","fr":"Les nuances","es":"Los matices","ar":"الفروق الدقيقة"},"tip":{"en":"Near-synonyms are never fully interchangeable. \"Slim\" flatters, \"skinny\" criticises, and \"thin\" simply describes. Always ask what a word suggests, not only what it means.","fr":"Les quasi-synonymes ne sont jamais tout à fait interchangeables. « Svelte » flatte, « maigre » critique et « mince » décrit simplement. Demandez-vous toujours ce qu'un mot suggère, pas seulement ce qu'il veut dire.","es":"Los casi sinónimos nunca son del todo intercambiables. «Esbelto» halaga, «flaco» critica y «delgado» solo describe. Pregúntate siempre qué sugiere una palabra, no solo qué significa.","ar":"لا تتبادل المترادفات المتقاربة مواقعها تماما. فكلمة «رشيق» تمدح و«هزيل» تنتقد و«نحيف» تصف فقط. اسأل دائما عما توحي به الكلمة، لا عما تعنيه فحسب."},"words":48,"lessons":[{"id":"a3-u02-l1","type":"learn","order":1,"title":{"en":"nuance, synonym, connotation","fr":"nuance, synonyme, connotation","es":"matiz, sinónimo, connotación","ar":"فارق دقيق، مرادف، دلالة ضمنية"},"count":11},{"id":"a3-u02-l2","type":"learn","order":2,"title":{"en":"skinny, slim, stubborn","fr":"maigre, svelte, têtu","es":"flaco, esbelto, terco","ar":"هزيل، رشيق، عنيد"},"count":10},{"id":"a3-u02-l3","type":"learn","order":3,"title":{"en":"affordable, stingy, thrifty","fr":"abordable, radin, économe","es":"asequible, tacaño, ahorrador","ar":"في المتناول، بخيل، مقتصد"},"count":11},{"id":"a3-u02-l4","type":"learn","order":4,"title":{"en":"brave, reckless, cautious","fr":"brave, téméraire, prudent","es":"valiente, temerario, prudente","ar":"شجاع، متهور، حذر"},"count":10},{"id":"a3-u02-l5","type":"learn","order":5,"title":{"en":"nosy, proud, arrogant","fr":"indiscret, fier, arrogant","es":"entrometido, orgulloso, arrogante","ar":"فضولي، فخور، متكبر"},"count":11},{"id":"a3-u02-l6","type":"learn","order":6,"title":{"en":"scent, stench, glance","fr":"senteur, puanteur, jeter un coup d'œil"